i-cool-teacher
i-cool-teacher is an open-source educational platform designed to empower educators. Our mission is to streamline lesson planning, foster interactive learning through custom flashcards, and provide multilingual support to meet diverse student needs.
Key Features
 * Custom Lesson Plans: Generate structured curricula tailored to specific grade levels and subjects.
 * Interactive Flashcards: Create engaging study aids to reinforce key concepts.
 * Multilingual Materials: Ensure accessibility for non-native speakers across all subjects.
Getting Started
This project is built to be adaptable and collaborative. We welcome contributions to expand our resource library and improve platform accessibility.
